  "notes": "控制面中断时保持已通的连接。\n\n- 控制接口连续失败三次时，先确认仍有回程流量，再决定要不要静默重启内核。\n- 已经证明在转发的连接会继续保持，并且不消耗那一次静默重启。\n",
  "notesEn": "Keep a live tunnel when the control API is down.\n\n- After three control-API failures, the app checks return traffic before the first silent core restart.\n- Proven forwarding keeps the session up and leaves that one restart unspent.\n",
